The shader and GlowPainter / RenderViewLayout render-engine classes are fetched
from the pinned commit at build time. GlowController includes a local freeze/
thaw adaptation of the original controller. The exact provision_service_state.xml
speaker vector is also fetched from that commit at build time. The welcome layout, permission list item appearance, blue check
vector, and OOBE page structure are adapted for the standalone RainKernel app.
The animation uses public Android PixelCopy, ActivityOptions, and
ViewAnimationUtils APIs instead of the closed-source
fan.transition.ActivityOptionsHelper. The build fetches the upstream LICENSE.
